  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is an <em>x</em>-coordinate of an <em>x</em>-intercept of the graph of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"y equals 3 left parenthesis x minus 14 right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 5 right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [],
